@copilot Remove the new regression suite from this PR and update this PR directly.

Delete instrumentation-docs/collect-test.sh entirely and remove the Test metadata collector step that invokes it from .github/workflows/metadata-validation.yml. Remove any remaining references to that deleted suite in repository files, if present. Do not replace it with another test suite.

Keep the consolidated collector, concrete telemetry-producing task registrations, cleanup behavior, platform handling, other workflow wiring, and other documentation intact. This is only removal of the newly added regression suite and its invocation, not a rollback of the collector fixes. Confirm there are no dangling references and run lightweight relevant checks without regenerating the full instrumentation inventory.
